; Reverse zone for the RFC1918 192.168.0.0/16 space (LAN + MetalLB).
; Apex only -- Knot 3.4 reverse-generate synthesises all PTR records from the
; A records in starnix.net (see applications/knot/knot.yaml in the ArgoCD repo).
; zonefile-load is difference-no-serial, so the SOA serial here is not used for
; change detection; Knot manages the served serial.
$ORIGIN 168.192.in-addr.arpa.
$TTL 86400
@   IN  SOA ns1.starnix.net. admin.starnix.net. (
            1          ; serial (ignored: difference-no-serial)
            3600       ; refresh
            900        ; retry
            1209600    ; expire
            3600       ; minimum
            )
@   IN  NS  ns1.starnix.net.
